126", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982696_1140112237846459_3391350817744798822_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HkIIXAF7WU0Q7kNvwHSTQuC&_nc_oc=AdrxStSgnCqqaT5wmb4gq3R71OB2Ydy-y0xazPmSB2ctDyi8a7m_7BPct4NpjPQmEZg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af22zwvWu5kLJx3OtABp4Qm9Emmc0H2LoWiwVLOyVPU1ag&oe=69D7B3C8"}, {"file_name": "Untitled design-12.png", "id": "1855003265306793", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031329_1855003268640126_3692145407816589862_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HeVr2BMIYk8Q7kNvwGbs-Uw&_nc_oc=AdpktcLKXBTc2usBt64xDXbuTnqcKAF8oYzXfGqHwFIT6cZpEROBfwE9Q9PSCwWRO6c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2233_KF4qvwJviRN0FShYyCqDhWOAaL6FzTfUflHFy3w&oe=69D7A644"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2024-09-19 at 5.04.56\u202fPM-2560x1440.png", "id": "3829319804053099", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035399_3829319807386432_8697232045329718283_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_k5pNp-9jnUQ7kNvwFV7jNb&_nc_oc=Adp5umNkqL7ho288XZ42BFWyuZXZJmXQz36SxTR6B5H64ICQ5gyI0tZuc5Y_ReRyREQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1hV08eavzGZIHC_cx2CnUdIqLjyfe4yjbbL2TH3_PzkQ&oe=69D7B556"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "LangScape.png", "id": "1950772375415851", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75207242_1950772378749184_9023911922798697221_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X6ShKAxxupgQ7kNvwHdaM6a&_nc_oc=AdqubxLCBIVgSjXvpceo1yxpuf8AYCO-UTupdZ2fMVCsSQfpohVO3WvCwZpOqvZjLrc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af14XMHQS5QiAjg-15Z4vOQa1Ae-j3FxTB6_CxdHewe6ag&oe=69D7B7A2"}, "display_name": "Retropy VR Puzzles", "keywords": ["puzzle", "puzzling", "scan", "jigsaw", "retropy"], "long_description": "\ud83e\udde9 Become a Puzzle Master. With 16 base puzzles and free monthly content, you will never run out of satisfying 3D jigsaw puzzles to complete. Ranging from easy to complex, there are a variety of themes to enjoy. \n\n{963016575775248}\n\n\ud83e\udde9 Exercise Brain Health. It's no secret that daily puzzles improve brain health. Relax in a whole new world of oddities and detailed puzzles crafted for relaxation and to improve cognitive function. \n\n{1113800780393627}\n\n\ud83e\udde9 Customize Your Puzzle Space. Enjoy detailed objects in your choice of immersive VR environments, change the music from energetic to relaxing, and make it your own!", "short_description": "Retropy VR Puzzles brings you hours of relaxing 3D jigsaw puzzles  in an immersive VR or MR space. Enjoy 16 base puzzles and 2 - 3 puzzles added each month for FREE. \n\nRanging in difficulty from Easy to Hard, adjust the challenge to your comfort and unlock achievements as you complete each puzzle. \n\nFeatures:\n16 Detailed objects to puzzle\nUnique VR environments \nA variety of music \nConstant updates and free content \n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://retropy.space/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://retropy.space/tos", "publisher_name": "Surf Punk Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://retropy.space/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9009